{"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.062323671976725281,"x":0.89667321545935352,"y":0.034373700635182081,"h":0.015554924257628944,"t":"Test 1"},{"t":"Now let me give you some idea of the layout of the farm. The building where you bought your","h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.079859072288587241,"w":0.7896907043457031,"x":0.065979389986385403,"c":1},{"x":0.065979389991008858,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.7896907043457031,"c":1,"y":0.095930232608314681,"t":"tickets is the New Barn, immediately to your right, and we're now at the beginning of the main"},{"y":0.11085661827377846,"w":0.78772628784179677,"h":0.01707360384678458,"c":1,"x":0.065935413682600197,"t":"path to the farmland - and of course the car park is on your left. Ihe scarecrow you can see."},{"c":1,"w":0.78350514729817711,"t":"in thecar park in the corner, beside the main path, is a traditional figure for keeping the birds","x":0.063917530005372966,"y":0.1264534885138282,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"w":0.78360834757486975,"x":0.063877481326905183,"h":0.017490534802009572,"t":"away from crops, but our scarecrow is a permanent sculpture. It's taller than a human being,","y":0.14241348637896123,"c":1},{"w":0.33402061462402344,"x":0.06597938335732205,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"so you can see it from quite a distance.","y":0.15988372085535441,"c":1},{"x":0.063917517638298407,"w":0.77938145955403637,"c":1,"y":0.18313953493148771,"t":"If you look ahead of you, you'll see a maze. It's opposite the New Barn, beside the side path","h":0.01453488361674482},{"x":0.86804123762343166,"t":"Q16","y":0.18313953468779109,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"t":"that branches off to the right just over there. The maze is made out of hedges which are too","x":0.063861201396863687,"h":0.017775278545028028,"y":0.19770931210763321,"w":0.77537546793619794,"c":1},{"t":"tall for young children to see over them, but it's quite small, so you can't get lost in it!","x":0.063867159959936928,"y":0.21481245334520471,"w":0.71558161417643229,"h":0.018571105482154016,"c":1},{"x":0.065979372164213054,"h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.84123713175455739,"y":0.2398255815626763,"c":1,"t":"Now, can you see the bridge crossing the fish pool further up the main path? If you want to go Q17"},{"c":1,"w":0.77938145955403648,"y":0.25572519082259282,"t":"to the café, go towards the bridge and turn right just before it. Walk along the side path and.","x":0.063917517633038587,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"c":1,"y":0.27180232574688989,"t":"the cafe's on the first bend you come to. The building was originally the schoolhouse, and it's","x":0.061855678731910377,"w":0.78969070434570321,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"well over a hundred years old.","h":0.013211978860833917,"x":0.063917525542599704,"c":1,"w":0.25773195902506507,"y":0.28919553738563819},{"x":0.063917521211648509,"w":0.76288660685221354,"c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.31238990034325886,"t":"As you may know, we run skills workshops here, where you can learn traditional crafts like"},{"y":0.32703488373034784,"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"woodwork and basket-making. You can see examples of the work, and talk to someone about","w":0.79381439208984372,"c":1,"x":0.063917547687036821},{"y":0.342948576802792,"t":"the courses, in the Black Barn. If you take the side path to the right, here, just by the New.","c":1,"w":0.76296376546223965,"h":0.017740754750778742,"x":0.061808525532872333},{"h":0.015954173878229061,"t":"Q18","x":0.86488653531035731,"y":0.34236491086355114,"c":1,"w":0.043592608769734698},{"t":"Barn, you'll come to the Black Barn just where the path first bends.","x":0.063917521213068471,"y":0.36046511621152244,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.56288660685221348,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.78556701660156247,"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"Now I mustn't forget to tell you about picnicking, as I can see some of you have brought your","x":0.063917522518520023,"y":0.38517441877173186},{"c":1,"t":"lunch with you. You can picnic in the field, though do clear up behind you, of course. Or if","x":0.061855672364332766,"h":0.014679976512037674,"w":0.76082473754882818,"y":0.40105695809841346},{"c":1,"x":0.86804123670503652,"t":"Q19","w":0.037113402684529673,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.40116279059408388},{"x":0.06391754746196085,"y":0.41569767438805139,"w":0.75670099894205722,"t":"you'd prefer a covered picnic area, there's one near the farmyard: just after you cross the","h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014945554929275295,"y":0.4328473080720191,"t":"bridge, there's a covered picnic spot on the right","x":0.063827768635814033,"w":0.41049011230468746},{"c":1,"h":0.016556444688887728,"t":"And the last thing to mention is Fiddy House itself. From here you can cross the bridge then","x":0.061802348550442525,"w":0.77742680867513014,"y":0.45616812649481342},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.8659793821652414,"t":"Q20","w":0.039175256093343158,"y":0.45639534873575616},{"t":"walk along the footpath through the field to the left of the farmyard. That goes to the house","c":1,"w":0.76916524251302087,"x":0.061801960089727853,"y":0.47154018125387442,"h":0.016855663785637631},{"c":1,"w":0.78556701660156258,"y":0.48825601876200642,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"and it'll give you a lovely view. of it. It's certainly worth a few photographs, but as it's a private","x":0.061855666853857939},{"w":0.3092783610026042,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"t":"home, I'm afraid you can't go inside.","x":0.061855664772998392,"y":0.5043604652784428},{"w":0.55480311075846356,"c":1,"x":0.061768152163470327,"y":0.52670924963735932,"h":0.019423335283137222,"t":"Right. Well, if you're all ready, we'll set off on our tour of the farm."},{"c":1,"t":"SECTION 3","x":0.061855671849247784,"y":0.57985907239182066,"w":0.16288659413655598,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"y":0.61191860487528904,"h":0.010174418083724102,"t":"LISA:","x":0.061855670140111653,"w":0.035051546096801757,"c":1},{"w":0.71752578735351569,"x":0.11958762165426663,"y":0.60892542554689488,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"OK, Greg, so I finally managed to read the article you mentioned - the one about the","c":1},{"y":0.6264534884161107,"w":0.23505154927571614,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"study on gender in physics.","x":0.11958762732090482},{"t":"GREG: About the study of college students done by Akira Miyake and his team? Yeah. I was","h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.061855682344020883,"y":0.64092777445989924,"w":0.77319585164388027,"c":1},{"t":"interested that the researchers were actually a mix of psychologists and physicists.","x":0.11546391899100787,"y":0.65843023260800293,"w":0.70721649169921885,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"That's an unusual combination.","x":0.11958762678399741,"w":0.26597938537597654,"h":0.013211978860833806,"y":0.67439812102243468},{"w":0.039175256093343103,"c":1,"x":0.059793815142761442,"y":0.69186046489761754,"t":"LISA:","h":0.011627907341393073},{"w":0.68659795125325529,"c":1,"t":"Yeah. I got a little confused at first about which students the study was based on.","x":0.11958762204282607,"y":0.68895348853509963,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"x":0.1195428740864232,"t":"They weren't actually majoring in physics ~ they were majoring in what's known as the. Q21","y":0.70490249191946375,"w":0.78361114501953133,"h":0.020340886454825791,"c":1},{"x":0.11946812684085449,"y":0.72006364605371864,"w":0.55488586425781239,"t":"STEM disciplines. That's science technology, engineering and....","h":0.018299361501661227,"c":1},{"x":0.13195875806987631,"t":"• and math. Yes, but they were all doing physics courses as part of their studies.","y":0.73691860481713312,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"w":0.67835052490234371},{"x":0.1195876216608347,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.75278919561261126,"t":"That's correct. So as I understood it, Miyake and co started from the fact that women","c":1,"w":0.71752578735351558},{"t":"are underrepresented in introductory physics courses at college, and also that on","h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"x":0.11958762223716216,"y":0.77034883737506643,"w":0.68659795125325529},{"y":0.7862595418517726,"w":0.69278350830078128,"x":0.11958762720072305,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"t":"average, the women who do enrol on these courses perform more poorly than the"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"men. No one really knows why this is the case.","y":0.80232558144217525,"w":0.40000000000000002,"c":1,"x":0.11752577308680709},{"y":0.81530175492478607,"t":"GREG: Yeah. But what the researchers wanted to find out was basically what they could do","c":1,"x":0.059680208057946799,"h":0.019495629732285358,"w":0.76721501668294267},{"h":0.014534883616744709,"y":0.8343023256313381,"w":0.73402064005533851,"t":"about the relatively low level of the women's results. But in order to find a solution they","c":1,"x":0.11752576234224478},{"y":0.84754917480920511,"w":0.4827598571777344,"c":1,"h":0.017339872739907225,"t":"needed to find out more about the nature of the problem.","x":0.11741754042371345},{"t":"LISA:","h":0.011627907341393073,"x":0.059793815097658347,"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343096,"y":0.86773255786031123},{"c":1,"x":0.11752578462743553,"t":"Right - now let's see if I can remember ... it was that in the physics class, the female","y":0.86627906981741587,"w":0.71958760579427083,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"x":0.11752576656697993,"w":0.68659795125325529,"c":1,"t":"students thought the male students all assumed that women weren't any good at","y":0.88226658859176621,"h":0.015989225189334433},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.68453608194986981,"c":1,"x":0.11546391461269404,"y":0.89812096274390174,"t":"physics... was that it? And they thought that the men expected them to get poor"},{"t":"results in their tests.","y":0.91424493981551003,"c":1,"x":0.11739137553538899,"h":0.013157127747728925,"w":0.17354460398356125},{"w":0.039175256093343047,"x":0.9134020628193078,"t":"105","c":1,"y":0.93749999990674382,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"w":0.29359642028808597,"y":0.9528574896638341,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35215793111227534,"h":0.0241128134153481}],"w":2400,"h":3406}